WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Advertise your product or brand here
contact www.OpenSubtitles.org today

2
00:15:24.424 --> 00:15:26.926
Shall we take Elias' daughter?

3
00:15:27.594 --> 00:15:30.180
The cells are packed solid. aren't they?

4
00:15:33.224 --> 00:15:35.518
What do you think of my new ship?

5
00:19:29.502 --> 00:19:31.170
Who are you?

6
00:21:52.937 --> 00:21:55.314
What did you hit now. Lloyd?

7
00:23:00.797 --> 00:23:01.797
The watch.

8
00:27:47.124 --> 00:27:48.284
She's flying towards the sun!

9
00:28:52.064 --> 00:28:53.107
We've lost our engines!

10
00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:56.402
Found them.

11
00:31:01.026 --> 00:31:01.777
Let her have him.

12
00:31:01.860 --> 00:31:04.029
Krem has the strength of one thousand men.

13
00:31:04.113 --> 00:31:05.473
He'll tear this little girl apart.

14
00:34:00.873 --> 00:34:02.374
Sorry. we are a bit backed up.

15
00:38:16.003 --> 00:38:17.003
Have you seen him?

16
00:42:30.340 --> 00:42:32.592
Is it now? I thought we had more time.

17
00:42:32.676 --> 00:42:35.512
So did I.
but Krypton's core is too unstable.

18
00:42:36.554 --> 00:42:37.681
It will explode in minutes.

19
00:42:38.265 --> 00:42:41.977
I have triggered the force field.
We need to go.

20
00:42:42.894 --> 00:42:43.561
Alura!

21
00:42:43.645 --> 00:42:44.645
Now!

22
00:42:54.447 --> 00:42:55.490
Is that him?

23
00:42:57.867 --> 00:42:58.867
That is Kal-El.

24
00:42:59.035 --> 00:43:01.755
The sweet little boy your brother has
declared a conqueror of worlds.

25
00:43:06.584 --> 00:43:08.003
It's time.

26
00:43:59.804 --> 00:44:02.891
Are we fools. Zor-El?

27
00:44:02.974 --> 00:44:06.353
Should we have listened to your brother?

28
00:44:06.436 --> 00:44:09.230
We can't send our daughter...

29
00:44:09.314 --> 00:44:11.441
to another planet to be some sort of god.

30
00:44:11.983 --> 00:44:13.985
We preserved all this for a reason.

31
00:44:15.737 --> 00:44:20.075
We have to believe there's a future here.

32
00:44:26.331 --> 00:44:29.376
Kara. where are you?

33
00:45:02.909 --> 00:45:04.035
Tell me.

34
00:45:05.954 --> 00:45:08.748
When Argo City broke off. it unearthed...

35
00:45:08.832 --> 00:45:13.211
a crystalline mineral
buried deep in the planet.

36
00:45:14.379 --> 00:45:15.379
Kryptonite.

37
00:45:16.548 --> 00:45:19.259
The soil has been poisoned.

38
00:45:19.676 --> 00:45:22.262
People are ill all over Argo...

39
00:45:22.554 --> 00:45:25.181
and it's spreading.

40
00:45:26.850 --> 00:45:29.853
And can it be helped?

41
00:45:46.494 --> 00:45:47.494
Kara.

42
00:45:48.997 --> 00:45:50.206
What is all this?

43
00:45:52.125 --> 00:45:54.627
Trying to preserve Argo
with my force field was a failure.

44
00:45:57.213 --> 00:46:01.384
The radiation has taken hold of me. too.

45
00:46:03.261 --> 00:46:04.971
I cannot let it get you.

46
00:46:08.850 --> 00:46:11.853
I found my brother's sketches
for the escape pod.

47
00:46:12.770 --> 00:46:14.355
I made it big enough for you.

48
00:46:15.982 --> 00:46:18.485
You will follow your cousin. Kal-El.

49
00:46:19.903 --> 00:46:22.947
You will make a new home on Earth.

50
00:46:25.742 --> 00:46:26.742
No!

51
00:46:28.119 --> 00:46:29.287
This is my home.

52
00:46:30.038 --> 00:46:33.833
This is my only home.

53
00:46:36.336 --> 00:46:38.880
Let the radiation take me too.

54
00:46:39.714 --> 00:46:43.676
I'll lie in the ground next to you
and next to mom.

55
00:46:47.263 --> 00:46:49.140
I am one tiny life.

56
00:46:50.266 --> 00:46:54.145
What difference does it make
whether I live or die?

57
00:46:54.229 --> 00:46:57.398
You are not one tiny life.

58
00:46:58.358 --> 00:47:01.319
You are your mother's life.

59
00:47:02.487 --> 00:47:04.280
You are my life.

60
00:47:05.406 --> 00:47:09.160
You are our souls unfolding
into the future.

61
00:47:10.370 --> 00:47:11.579
My child...

62
00:47:12.247 --> 00:47:15.166
this is why you must live.

63
00:47:27.720 --> 00:47:29.472
When I am gone.

64
00:47:30.807 --> 00:47:34.602
I need you to promise me something.

65
00:47:35.353 --> 00:47:36.521
Of course. mother.

66
00:47:38.356 --> 00:47:40.525
Just be good.

67
00:47:40.608 --> 00:47:44.946
That doesn't mean you cannot be tough.

68
00:47:45.029 --> 00:47:48.283
And that doesn't mean you have to be nice.

69
00:47:50.618 --> 00:47:52.579
But you must be good.

70
00:48:01.588 --> 00:48:04.382
We do not choose our paths.

71
00:48:06.217 --> 00:48:08.845
Your path will be one of great effort...

72
00:48:11.139 --> 00:48:13.433
of great purpose.

73
00:48:15.268 --> 00:48:20.481
Where you are going.
you will have enormous power.

74
00:48:22.025 --> 00:48:23.443
Use it to protect those...

75
00:48:23.526 --> 00:48:25.653
who cannot protect themselves.

76
00:48:27.363 --> 00:48:29.115
Trust yourself...

77
00:48:29.574 --> 00:48:30.992
to know what is right. Kara.

78
00:49:12.825 --> 00:49:14.118
We are with you.

79
00:52:25.685 --> 00:52:28.896
Bomar. stop! It's for our daughter.
we have no choice.

80
00:56:11.702 --> 00:56:12.787
Bring me their daughter.

81
00:56:12.870 --> 00:56:13.913
Now.

82
00:56:48.489 --> 00:56:49.990
The brides!

83
00:56:50.157 --> 00:56:51.242
Get them! Get them!

84
00:58:09.320 --> 00:58:10.738
A deal is a deal.

85
00:58:11.739 --> 00:58:12.990
She has to die.

86
01:06:59.850 --> 01:07:01.143
I don't understand you.

87
01:07:01.810 --> 01:07:03.103
Where am I?

88
01:07:03.437 --> 01:07:05.439
Is this Earth?

89
01:07:06.440 --> 01:07:07.774
Are you Kal-El?

90
01:07:21.288 --> 01:07:22.831
Krypto. be good. buddy.

91
01:07:23.665 --> 01:07:24.665
Be good.

92
01:08:24.476 --> 01:08:26.812
Why is he in his underwear?

93
01:08:48.875 --> 01:08:50.627
How can this be home?

94
01:15:15.094 --> 01:15:17.555
A dead Kryptonian...

95
01:15:17.889 --> 01:15:21.309
should make for a magnificent trophy.

96
01:15:21.559 --> 01:15:23.853
I'm working on it.

97
01:17:48.790 --> 01:17:49.832
Get off your fat ass...

98
01:17:50.458 --> 01:17:51.542
and take her to Krem.

99
01:17:51.626 --> 01:17:52.710
He'll shut her up.

100
01:18:12.438 --> 01:18:14.232
Keep your trap shut and do as you're told.

101
01:21:02.066 --> 01:21:04.902
Where you are going.
you will have enormous power.

102
01:21:05.152 --> 01:21:07.113
I need you to promise me something.

103
01:21:10.032 --> 01:21:11.576
Use it to protect those...

104
01:21:11.659 --> 01:21:13.619
who cannot protect themselves.

104
